// session.error without sessionID: soleHolder = !pooledServerKey || sharedOpencodePoolRefCount(key) <= 1; drop when !soleHolder || no ctx || ctx not running.
// Stale filter: messageID | partID | part.id->partID | part.messageID | info.id | tool.messageID in staleMessageIds -> drop.
// awaitingTurnActivity && session.status retry -> drop (ambiguous pre-activity retry).
// question.replied|question.rejected -> clearPendingQuestion(requestID), return.
// No running ctx -> drop. part.updated/delta with fresh identity -> currentTurnHasTerminalAssistantMessage=false.
// message.updated assistant info -> currentTurnHasTerminalAssistantMessage = (time.completed finite && error == null && finish !== "tool-calls").
