//   session.text.delta | session.message.content.updated -> assistantMessageID/messageID overrides item id; delta appended + agentMessage/delta notification; snapshot longer than streamed -> emit only the extra slice;
//   stream end without outcome -> failed "closed before terminal"; abort -> interrupted.
// POST /api/session/:id/prompt {text} admitted after feed opens; !ok -> abort + throw.
// On success: GET /api/session/:id/message -> newest assistant entry (type|info.role|role == "assistant", text from content|parts text parts, newest by time.created) overrides streamed text;
// emitItem inProgress + completed agentMessage item; ctx.status="completed"; turn/completed notification.
// timedOut -> terminate failed "OpenCode v2 turn timed out"; other errors while ctx running -> terminate failed + rethrow; finally clear timeout + v2TurnAbort.
// DEFECT: nested async closure readFeed/handleEvent + Promise outcome — sequential feed loop with outcome fields on a local struct (fix phase).
fn executeTurnV2(self: &OpencodeCompatibleRuntime, prompt_ptr: ptr, prompt_len: u64, turnId_ptr: ptr, turnId_len: u64) -> i32 {
    return 0;
}

